OL,3,GNEWSAWhat could make Milton Keynes a   
OL,4,ACity of Culture?                       
OL,6,FIt's a big week for Milton Keynes as it
OL,7,Fbattles with Wrexham, Sheffield and    
OL,8,FBlackpool for the illustrious #10m     
OL,9,Fprize of 2029 City of Culture.         
OL,11,FA panel of judges, including the       
OL,12,Fcreator of Grange Hill and Brookside,  
OL,13,FSir Phil Redmond, are visiting the city
OL,14,Fbefore making a decision on the winner 
OL,15,Fin the new year.                       
