OL,3,GNEWSAWhat could make Milton Keynes a   
OL,4,ACity of Culture?                       
OL,6,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy said:     
OL,7,F"Every place has a story worth telling 
OL,8,Fof its own unique history, identity and
OL,9,Fcontribution. It has been amazing to   
OL,10,Fsee this year's bidders showcase what  
OL,11,Fmakes their community claim such a     
OL,12,Fspecial place in our national story."  
OL,14,FSo, what will judges discover that     
OL,15,Fmakes Milton Keynes so unique?         
